          "baseline_test_path": "src/test/java/dev/atmcompanion/activity/ActivityWindowAcceptanceTest.java",
          "expected_cases": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "T008",
          "request": "Add `QuestOverview.fromSnapshot(QuestSnapshot snapshot, String timestamp)`. Preserve the source version, team scope, lock flag, and declared availability rule. Count all observed chapters, all observed quests, and completed quests from the snapshot; use the snapshot's validated available-ID list for the available count. Build options from the first `MAX_OPTIONS` available IDs in their existing sorted order, resolving each ID to its quest title and chapter ID. Preserve the fixed omitted-details text. Do not infer dependencies, availability, or task details.",
          "request_sha256": "6284769de3d0d36f40d1ba8b18011f3b42cfcbbbb877e5b5c428883946b604bb",
          "test_path": "frozen-tests/QuestOverviewSnapshotProjectionAcceptanceTest.java",
